guide polestar-experimental/riverglades-horde-1
title Riverglades 1: Powderfuse Port, Rog'mar and the western farms (experimental)
faction Horde
levels 37-40
zone Riverglades
coords live
folder Riverglades · Experimental
why Forever's new zone, an alpha route written from players' recordings.
keywords riverglades, rog'mar, powderfuse port, bristle hills, meadowsbrook, cinderscale, experimental, alpha
next polestar-experimental/riverglades-horde-2
pitch Forever's new zone south of the Badlands: the Horde fort of Rog'mar and about 70 quests from level 40, then back to Kargath for Feralas.
pro Reaches level 60 about 40 minutes sooner than the Stranglethorn Vale route
pro Replaces Stranglethorn Vale and the Swamp of Sorrows with one zone and one hub
pro You ride in from Kargath through the Badlands' southern edge, and come back out at Kargath for Feralas & Tanaris
con Experimental: written from players' recordings and not yet checked end to end in the game
con Skips Stranglethorn Vale and the Swamp of Sorrows: their quests left in your log can be abandoned, and Stonard's flight path waits until later
con Its later quests are for levels 43-45, a few levels above you when you reach them: pull carefully
con Elite camps, and a few quests that need a group (each behind a group choice)

# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Horde, part 1 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone (123 sessions to 2026-11-12) and Forever's quest data (the client's quest records,
# QuestieDB 1.0.16 and EG Link) for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: the way in by the goblin boat from Tanaris (how most recorded Horde players arrived; Kargath's flight path,
# the other way in, comes only with our later Badlands guide), Powderfuse Port, Sleebo's workshop, Rog'mar (flight
# path, inn), Neza Bloodsnout's three hunts on the plains with Sleebo's marsh on the first one, a western loop
# (Turner's Logging Camp, the Bristle Hills, Gelinda Coppergleam's Cinderscale hollow, Meadowsbrook) and the hearth
# home, the training grounds, then the river and the Farholde training camp.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): Poison Tips after Feathers for Fletching,
# A Hunter's Quiver after Poison Tips, Gnoll Infestation, Bristle Hills Bandits and Snargl's Snout after A Hunter's
# Quiver; A Gift From Our Enemies after Food for the Taking; Show Them How It's Done after both of Krom'rosh's first
# quests; A Serving of Strength after A Gift From Our Enemies; Stick 'Em after Fetch 'n' Fletch; The Goblin Trader
# after Borrowed Blades; Rock 'em and Sock 'em after Gaseous Gold; Tran'gul's quests after Show Them How It's Done
# (part 2).
# Elites, each behind a group choice: Snargl (40), Ombassa (41), Ghostmaw (42); Scoutmaster Vargas (42) in part 2.
# Left out on purpose:
# - On the Other Side (95033): Tan'jani's errand ends at Camp Mojache in Feralas.
# - Hail the Dragonslayer (95936): it starts from the head of Scaldaron, a rare elite drake in the Cinderscale
#   hollow.
# - The breadcrumbs from other zones (Report to Rog'mar 95141, Finding Tan'jani 95143): this guide doesn't assume
#   you carry them; While-you're-here hands them in when you have them.

step Fly to Freewind Post
  when !zone "Riverglades"
  tip Experimental route (alpha). It follows what players did in the Riverglades and may still have rough spots: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip The Riverglades lie across the sea from Tanaris: a goblin boat sails from Steamwheedle Port, north-east of Gadgetzan, to Powderfuse Port. Fly to Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and head south-east through the Shimmering Flats to Gadgetzan. (If you already know Kargath in the Badlands, the way in through Twilight's Shroud works too.)
  fly "Freewind Post"

step Gadgetzan
  when !zone "Riverglades"
  zone Tanaris
  tip Learn Gadgetzan's flight path: it saves the ride next time.
  getfp "Gadgetzan"

step Boat to Powderfuse Port
  when !zone "Riverglades"
  zone Tanaris
  tip Steamwheedle Port is on the coast north-east of Gadgetzan: wait on the pier for the goblin boat to Powderfuse Port.
  goto 67.57,23.1 "Boat to Powderfuse Port"

step Powderfuse Port
  zone Riverglades
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Friz Frazzlespark keeps a stall at the west end of the docks. The port's other jobs are for later (part 3): this crate goes to the Horde's fort.
  accept 95062                          -- Frazzlespark's Crate: for Krom'rosh in Rog'mar

step Sleebo's workshop
  tip West up the road from the port: Sleebo Fizzlespout has his workshop on the hill. The gas vents are in the marsh south-west of it, on your first hunt for Neza.
  accept 96063                          -- Gaseous Gold

step Rog'mar
  tip West to Rog'mar, the Horde's fort in the middle of the zone. Neza Bloodsnout stands on its east side, Kreza Darkthorn and Krom'rosh in the middle with Grakna, the wind rider master; Innkeeper Toka and Tan'jani on the west side.
  accept 96107                          -- Neza Bloodsnout: Feathers for Fletching
  accept 93788                          -- Kreza Darkthorn: Borrowed Blades
  turnin 95062                          -- Krom'rosh
  accept 93786                          -- A Message in Blood
  accept 93787                          -- Food for the Taking
  getfp "Rog'mar" npc 255993            -- Grakna, in the middle of the fort
  sethome "Rog'mar" npc 256675         -- Innkeeper Toka
  accept 95951                          -- Tan'jani: Fetch 'n' Fletch

step The plains and the marsh
  tip South-east of Rog'mar the plains run down to Terral's Watch. The Low Plains Buzzards circle everywhere; a picked carcass lies in the grass (its skull starts A Feast for Buzzards), and the marsh vents are just past it.
  collect 271793 x6 quest 96107.1       -- Plains Buzzard Feather
  accept 96103                          -- Picked Carcass: A Feast for Buzzards
  collect 272004 x8 quest 96063.1       -- Marsh Gas Vial

step Sleebo Fizzlespout
  tip North-east to the workshop. Sleebo's stress test is a fight with his G45-B4G beside the workshop: hand the quest in once it's beaten.
  turnin 96063
  accept 96067                          -- Rock 'em and Sock 'em
  complete 96067 @68.2,48.6             -- the stress test: beat G45-B4G beside the workshop
  turnin 96067

step Neza Bloodsnout
  tip West back to Rog'mar's east side.
  turnin 96107
  accept 96108                          -- Poison Tips
  turnin 96103
  accept 96104                          -- Song of the Strider

step The vipers and the tallstriders
  tip The Glade Vipers hide in the long grass south-east of town; the Roving Tallstriders graze beside them. Cavalry Scout Alturin, an Alliance elite (level 45), rides the road from Terral's Watch to Wheeler's Grange along the grass's south-west edge: keep clear of him.
  collect 271776 x4 quest 96108.1       -- Glade Viper Venom
  collect 271778 quest 96104.1          -- Intact Tallstrider Beak

step Neza Bloodsnout
  turnin 96108
  accept 96109                          -- A Hunter's Quiver
  turnin 96104

step King of the Wild Plains
  when group 96105
  tip Ombassa, an elite lion (level 41), prowls the plains south of Rog'mar, where the lions are: grouping up is advised.
  accept 96105                          -- Neza Bloodsnout

step The lions
  tip The Wildplains lions roam the plains just south of Rog'mar.
  collect 266888 x6 quest 96109.1       -- Prized Lion Hide

step Ombassa
  when group 96105
  collect 281052 quest 96105.1 @59.6,53.6  -- Ombassa's Hide

step Neza Bloodsnout
  turnin 96109
  accept 94532                          -- Gnoll Infestation

step Neza's elites
  when onquest 96105
  turnin 96105

step Snargl's Snout
  when group 94533
  tip Snargl is an elite gnoll (level 40) who roams the south-western camps of the Bristle Hills: grouping up is advised.
  accept 94533                          -- Neza Bloodsnout

step Kreza Darkthorn
  accept 94535                          -- Bristle Hills Bandits

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip South-west across the river to the Alliance lumber camp. The lumberjacks carry the axes. Loot Wood Bundles from the Peasant Woodpiles around the camp and use them to fletch Makeshift Stickin' Spears. Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), prowls the river by the camp: if he comes your way, back off and let him pass.
  collect 263972 x10 quest 93788.1      -- Woodworker's Axe
  collect 271629 @39.2,62.8             -- Wood Bundle, from the Peasant Woodpiles
  use 271629 quest 95951.1 @39.2,62.8   -- Wood Bundle: fletch it into Makeshift Stickin' Spears

step The Bristle Hills
  tip West into the Bristle Hills: the Redridge gnolls camp along the slopes and carry the stolen ore. Work south-west through their camps.
  kill 255770 x8 quest 94532.1          -- Redridge Mystic
  kill 255772 x8 quest 94532.2          -- Redridge Trapper
  kill 255769 x6 quest 94532.3          -- Redridge Brute
  collect 265358 x40 quest 94535.1      -- Stolen Ore

step Snargl
  when group 94533
  collect 265357 quest 94533.1 @16.1,73.2  -- Snargl's Snout

step Gelinda Coppergleam
  tip South-east out of the hills: Gelinda Coppergleam, a prospector who deals with both sides, has camped by the Cinderscale dragonkin's hollow.
  accept 95792                          -- Clear 'em Out
  accept 95934                          -- Proof of Profit

step The Cinderscale hollow
  tip The whelps nest all over the hollow; the warriors guard its back, by the Cubic Draconia. The warriors are level 41-42: pull them one at a time. Scaldaron, a rare elite drake, can be up here too: leave him be unless you have a group.
  kill 262473 x8 quest 95792.1 @30.0,72.2  -- Cinderscale Whelp
  kill 262477 x4 quest 95792.2 @29.6,73.1  -- Cinderscale Warrior
  collect 271611 quest 95934.1          -- Cubic Draconia

step Gelinda Coppergleam
  turnin 95792
  turnin 95934

step Meadowsbrook
  tip East to Meadowsbrook, the Alliance farm by the river: the farmhands work the fields and the feed satchels lie by the barns. Southern Watch, the Alliance outpost on the road, has guards: pass south of it.
  kill 256383 x12 quest 93786.1         -- Meadowsbrook Farmhand
  collect 262640 x6 quest 93787.1       -- Feed Satchel

step Hearth to Rog'mar
  hearth "Rog'mar"

step Rog'mar
  tip Your hearth lands by Innkeeper Toka on the fort's west side: Tan'jani first, then Krom'rosh, Gorg by the cook fire, Kreza and Neza on your way east through the fort.
  turnin 95951                          -- Tan'jani
  accept 95955                          -- Stick 'Em
  turnin 93786                          -- Krom'rosh
  turnin 93787
  accept 94480                          -- A Gift From Our Enemies
  accept 94483                          -- Show Them How It's Done
  turnin 94480                          -- Gorg, by the cook fire
  accept 94481                          -- A Serving of Strength
  turnin 93788                          -- Kreza Darkthorn
  turnin 94535
  accept 93976                          -- The Goblin Trader: for Friz Frazzlespark in Powderfuse Port, keep it
  turnin 94532                          -- Neza Bloodsnout

step Neza Bloodsnout
  when onquest 94533
  turnin 94533

step WANTED: Ghostmaw
  when group 95992
  tip Ghostmaw is an elite (level 42) who hunts along the river south-west of Rog'mar, by the Farholde camp you go to next: grouping up is advised. The poster hangs in the middle of the fort.
  accept 95992                          -- the WANTED! poster


step The training grounds
  tip North of the fort the Rog'mar Trainees drill: use Gorg's Hearty Stew on them.
  use 265066 quest 94481.1 @60.8,37.0   -- Hearty Stew

step Gorg
  turnin 94481

step The river and the Farholde camp
  tip South-west of Rog'mar the river runs between the farms: impale the Freshwater Crocolisks with Tan'jani's spears. The Alliance trains its scouts and priests at a camp on the far bank. Cavalry Scout Alturin, the Alliance elite, rides the road just east of the camp: pull the scouts and priests away from it.
  use 271639 quest 95955.1 @51.9,57.1   -- Tan'jani's spears, on the Freshwater Crocolisks
  kill 270667 x8 quest 94483.1          -- Farholde Priest
  kill 257926 x12 quest 94483.2         -- Farholde Scout

step Ghostmaw
  when group 95992
  collect 271828 quest 95992.1 @50.0,54.4  -- Ghostmaw's Fang

step Rog'mar
  turnin 95955                          -- Tan'jani
  turnin 94483                          -- Krom'rosh

step Tan'jani
  when onquest 95992
  turnin 95992
